  ('wyr-absurd-30', 'Have to do the Macarena dance for 30 seconds before every meal you eat', 'Have to moonwalk whenever you walk across a kitchen floor', 'absurd', 1003, 1387, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-31', 'Be cursed so that every song you sing along to in the car is auto-tuned into T-Pain', 'Be cursed so that every movie you watch has the characters voiced by Nicolas Cage', 'absurd', 914, 1007, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-32', 'Have your pet cat suddenly start speaking fluent French with an attitude', 'Have your pet dog suddenly reveal he has a PhD in Economics from Harvard', 'absurd', 714, 775, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-33', 'Only be able to wear clown shoes for the rest of your life (they squeak with every step)', 'Only be able to wear a bright orange construction helmet everywhere you go', 'absurd', 822, 1020, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-34', 'Have your eyelashes be 6 inches long like feather dusters', 'Have your fingernails glow in the dark like mini glowsticks', 'absurd', 1084, 595, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-35', 'Have a personal narrator who aggressively recaps what happened yesterday every morning when you wake up', 'Have credits roll across your field of vision with dramatic orchestra music whenever you go to sleep', 'absurd', 771, 1019, 1),
