  ('wyr-absurd-37', 'Have a tiny pocket-sized clone of yourself that sits on your shoulder and gives terrible advice', 'Have an evil twin who is polite and bakes cookies for your friends to make you look bad', 'absurd', 1225, 735, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-38', 'Every time you drop something, it bounces back up into your hand with cartoon sound effects', 'Every time you trip, you do a stylish Olympic gymnastics flip and land on your feet', 'absurd', 196, 309, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-39', 'Have to end every phone call with "I love you, unconditionally" regardless of who it is', 'Have to answer every phone call by saying "Joe’s Crematorium, you kill ’em, we grill ’em"', 'absurd', 872, 1218, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-40', 'Have your car horn make the sound of a screaming goat', 'Have your doorbell make the sound of a dramatic church organ chord', 'absurd', 662, 1035, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-41', 'Be able to summon a flock of 50 aggressive seagulls on command to mildly inconvenience your enemies', 'Be able to summon 10 confused raccoons who inspect people’s shoes', 'absurd', 921, 1059, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-42', 'Have teeth that glow neon green under blacklight at parties', 'Have ears that wiggle like rabbit ears whenever you hear good news', 'absurd', 1123, 797, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-43', 'Have every chair you sit on feel like a cloud massage chair', 'Have every bed you sleep in smell like fresh lavender and warm sunshine', 'absurd', 551, 782, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-44', 'Only be able to write in Comic Sans font for the rest of your life', 'Only be able to speak in rhyming Dr. Seuss couplets whenever you order fast food', 'absurd', 479, 826, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-45', 'Have a mustache made of actual licorice that regrows when you nibble on it', 'Have eyebrows that do "the wave" across your forehead whenever you are thinking', 'absurd', 631, 387, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-46', 'Turn into a golden retriever for 1 hour every full moon', 'Turn into an owl for 1 hour every solar eclipse', 'absurd', 631, 1025, 1),
  ('wyr-absurd-47', 'Every time you wash your hands, the soap forms into cute origami animals', 'Every time you brew coffee, the foam creates portraits of famous historical figures', 'absurd', 343, 224, 1),
